    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i think i had an allergic reaction to something i ate at lunch. my skin is all itchy and red and my face feels kinda puffy too. my throat feels a little tight like i cant swallow as easy but it might just be anxiety? should i just take a benadryl and see if it goes away or is this bad?",
