      "content": "the bread thing sounds weird lol but okay. i have some benadryl here. if i take it and it starts working, can i just sleep it off? i dont really want to go to the er if i dont have to, its kind of expensive and i feel okay enough to just rest. do you think an antihistamine is enough to stop the swelling in my throat?",
