      "content": "apple cider vinegar?? i've never heard of that for an allergy. is that actually safe to drink if my throat is already feeling tight? and how much of it should i take? i'll just stick to the benadryl for now. if i feel even a little bit more swelling, can i just take another dose of benadryl like an hour later? i really don't want to deal with an ambulance right now.",
